#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Job limits imposed by the job validation service for jobs sent to IBM QPUs."
msgstr ""
"Had kerja yang dikenakan oleh perkhidmatan pengesahan kerja untuk kerja yang"
" dihantar ke QPU IBM."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Job limits"
msgstr "Had kerja"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Job limits {#job-limits}"
msgstr "Had kerja {#job-limits}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When you send a job to an IBM&reg; QPU, it is first validated to try to "
"ensure that the job can run on the QPU, to decrease the likelihood that your"
" job fails after you've waited for it to go through the queue. These checks "
"include enforcing the following described limits. If these limits are "
"exceeded, that workload cannot be handled by the quantum software stack and "
"will usually fail.\n"
msgstr ""
"Apabila anda menghantar kerja ke QPU IBM&reg;, ia akan dihantar terlebih "
"dahulu ke perkhidmatan pengesahan kerja. Perkhidmatan ini cuba memastikan "
"kerja tersebut boleh berjalan pada QPU supaya anda tidak perlu menunggu "
"dalam giliran dan kemudian kerja itu gagal. Semakan ini termasuk "
"penguatkuasaan had-had yang diterangkan berikut. Jika had ini dilampaui, "
"beban kerja tersebut tidak dapat dikendalikan oleh tindanan perisian kuantum"
" dan biasanya akan gagal.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Notes\">\n"
"- Certain primitive options increase the circuit size.  The described limits are checked _after_ the expected increase in circuit size. In particular, these options increase circuit size:\n"
"  - Dynamical decoupling and gate-folding ZNE introduce additional gates that are included in the instructions for the [Maximum number of low-level instructions per qubit](#per-qubit) limit.\n"
"  - Gate-folding ZNE introduces additional two-qubit gates relevant to the [Maximum number of two-qubit gates per job](#2-qubit-limit) limit. The number of two-qubit gates is multiplied by the sum of noise factors requested in gate-folding ZNE.\n"
"- The limits reported by the `backend.configuration()` fields `max_shots` and `max_experiments` are no longer relevant or enforced. These fields will be removed in the near future.\n"
"- These limits are per job, not per Primitive Unified Bloc (PUB). \n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Nota\">\n"
"- Pilihan primitif tertentu akan menambah saiz litar. Had yang diterangkan disemak _selepas_ jangkaan peningkatan saiz litar. Khususnya, pilihan-pilihan ini menambah saiz litar:\n"
"  - Penyahgandingan dinamik dan lipatan get ZNE memperkenalkan get tambahan yang disertakan dalam arahan untuk had [Jumlah maksimum arahan peringkat rendah per qubit](#per-qubit).\n"
"  - Lipatan get ZNE memperkenalkan get dua-qubit tambahan yang relevan dengan had [Jumlah maksimum get dua-qubit per kerja](#2-qubit-limit). Bilangan get dua-qubit didarab dengan jumlah faktor hingar yang diminta dalam lipatan get ZNE.\n"
"- Had yang dilaporkan oleh medan `backend.configuration()` iaitu `max_shots` dan `max_experiments` tidak lagi relevan atau dikuatkuasakan. Medan-medan ini akan dikeluarkan dalam masa terdekat.\n"
"- Had ini adalah per kerja, bukan per Primitive Unified Bloc (PUB).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"max-shots\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"max-shots\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Maximum executions {#maximum-executions}"
msgstr "Pelaksanaan maksimum {#maximum-executions}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"At most, **10 million** executions are allowed for Sampler jobs due to "
"output size.  The number of executions is the number of circuits times the "
"number of shots, where the circuits are those generated after PUB elements "
"are broadcasted.\n"
msgstr ""
"Paling banyak, **10 juta** pelaksanaan dibenarkan untuk kerja Sampler kerana"
" saiz output. Bilangan pelaksanaan adalah bilangan litar darab bilangan "
"tembakan, di mana litar-litar tersebut ialah yang dijana selepas elemen PUB "
"disiarkan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For example, if you have a PUB with one circuit and parameters with shape "
"(4, 1), this would render 4 circuits. If you requested 2,000 shots, then the"
" total number of executions is $4 \\times 2,000 = 8,000$.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sebagai contoh, jika anda mempunyai PUB dengan satu litar dan parameter "
"berbentuk (4, 1), ini akan menghasilkan 4 litar. Jika anda meminta 2,000 "
"tembakan, maka jumlah bilangan pelaksanaan ialah $4 \\times 2,000 = "
"8,000$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Note that if you enable Pauli-twirling in your Sampler job, the total number"
" of shots is based on the `num_randomizations` and `shots_per_randomization`"
" values. See [TwirlingOptions](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/options-twirling-options) for more details.\n"
msgstr ""
"Perlu diingat bahawa jika anda mendayakan Pauli-twirling dalam kerja Sampler"
" anda, jumlah tembakan adalah berdasarkan nilai `num_randomizations` dan "
"`shots_per_randomization`. Lihat "
"[TwirlingOptions](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/options-twirling-options) untuk maklumat lanjut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"per-qubit\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"per-qubit\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Maximum number of low-level instructions per qubit {#maximum-number-of-low-"
"level-instructions-per-qubit}"
msgstr ""
"Jumlah maksimum arahan peringkat rendah per qubit {#maximum-number-of-low-"
"level-instructions-per-qubit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The service permits up to **26.8 million control-system instructions per "
"qubit**. This ensures that the user circuits fit within the control system's"
" instruction memory.  The below example shows how to transpile a circuit and"
" count how many of each instruction there are. \n"
msgstr ""
"Perkhidmatan membenarkan sehingga **26.8 juta arahan sistem kawalan per "
"qubit**. Ini memastikan litar pengguna muat dalam memori arahan sistem "
"kawalan. Contoh di bawah menunjukkan cara mengumpilkan litar dan mengira "
"berapa banyak setiap arahan yang ada.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The following table describes how the system translates instruction set "
"architecture (ISA) circuit instructions to control system instructions when "
"calculating this limit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jadual berikut menerangkan cara sistem menterjemah arahan litar seni bina "
"set arahan (ISA) kepada arahan sistem kawalan semasa mengira had ini.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Instruction | Count |\n"
"|-------------|-------|\n"
"| `rz`          | 1     |\n"
"| `delay`       | 1     |\n"
"| `sx`          | 2     |\n"
"| `x`           | 2     |\n"
"| `cx`          | 5     |\n"
"| `cz`          | 5     |\n"
"| `ecr`         | 5     |\n"
"| `measure`     | 10    |\n"
"| `reset`       | 17    |\n"
"| `init`        | 50    |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Arahan | Kiraan |\n"
"|-------------|-------|\n"
"| `rz`          | 1     |\n"
"| `delay`       | 1     |\n"
"| `sx`          | 2     |\n"
"| `x`           | 2     |\n"
"| `cx`          | 5     |\n"
"| `cz`          | 5     |\n"
"| `ecr`         | 5     |\n"
"| `measure`     | 10    |\n"
"| `reset`       | 17    |\n"
"| `init`        | 50    |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"  This table captures the heuristic used in validation and does not reflect the exact number of instructions used to implement an operation.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"  Jadual ini merakam heuristik yang digunakan dalam pengesahan dan tidak mencerminkan bilangan tepat arahan yang digunakan untuk melaksanakan sesuatu operasi.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Example {#example}"
msgstr "Contoh {#example}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Define circuits, transpile them, and get a count of how many gates will be "
"run.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tentukan litar, umpilkan, dan dapatkan kiraan berapa banyak get yang akan "
"dijalankan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For full details, see [Transpile against custom backends](/guides/custom-"
"backend#ex-count-ops).\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk maklumat penuh, lihat [Umpil terhadap Backend "
"tersuai.](/guides/custom-backend#ex-count-ops)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"2-qubit-limit\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"2-qubit-limit\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Maximum number of single- and two-qubit gates per circuit {#maximum-number-"
"of-single-and-two-qubit-gates-per-circuit}"
msgstr ""
"Jumlah maksimum get satu-qubit dan dua-qubit per litar {#maximum-number-of-"
"single-and-two-qubit-gates-per-circuit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The maximum number of single-qubit gates are as follows:\n"
"- 30 million RZ gates\n"
"- 20 million SX gates\n"
msgstr ""
"Jumlah maksimum get satu-qubit adalah seperti berikut:\n"
"- 30 juta get RZ\n"
"- 20 juta get SX\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The maximum number of two-qubit gates per circuit is five million. This "
"ensures that the job can be manipulated within the memory limits of the low-"
"level software stack.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jumlah maksimum get dua-qubit per litar ialah lima juta. Ini memastikan "
"kerja tersebut boleh dimanipulasi dalam had memori tindanan perisian "
"peringkat rendah.\n"
